 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Old Moses stood by the Jordan, a hundred and twenty years",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He could not cross the river, but he did not speak with fear",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD your God himself will cross over ahead of you",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Joshua will lead you, as the LORD has said he'd do",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Be strong and courageous",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be afraid, do not be terrified",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the LORD your God goes with you",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will never fail you or forsake you",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he called young Joshua in the sight of all the land",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Said the road ahead is yours now, and the people in your hand",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will bring them to the country that the LORD swore long ago",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To the fathers as their inheritance, so take it, and go",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Be strong and courageous",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be afraid, do not be terrified",
